invariant: INV-14
file: tcp_nonblocking.c
catches: webpki_loop_tcp_nonblocking
reason: the webpki ch_record_init hashes the configuration for a session
  that takes tickets but leaves ch_tls.takes_tickets at 0. So
  handshake_post.c gives no ticket to on_ticket, and no session can
  resume. The loop's full handshake requires one ticket.

--- old
    r->t.takes_tickets = (uint8_t)webpki_takes_tickets(cfg);
    if (r->t.takes_tickets) {
--- new
    if (webpki_takes_tickets(cfg)) {
